flowchart TB
    accTitle: Target Robotics Infrastructure Architecture
    accDescr: Green nodes are existing local contract and collaboration files. Blue nodes are planned code. Gray nodes are external consumers or simulator environments. Solid arrows mean uses or calls; dotted arrows express development and data constraints.

    subgraph public_repo["robotics：独立公开仓库"]
        direction TB
        subgraph foundation["已有本地基座"]
            direction LR
            collaboration["AGENTS · 任务卡 · PR / 交接模板<br/>已有文件；远端规则待启用"]
            contracts["schemas · validator · CPU tests<br/>已实现：数据与事件校验"]
        end
        subgraph target_code["目标代码：均待实现"]
            direction TB
            entry["实验入口<br/>模型 × 场景 × 协议 × 设备"]
            runner["ProtocolRunner<br/>时钟 · 延迟 · 队列 · 终止"]
            policy["PolicyAdapter<br/>Cosmos-Policy · LingBot-VA · π0.5"]
            simulator["SimulatorAdapter<br/>按后端实现推进 / 采样 / reset"]
            shared_core["streaming_infra<br/>算子后端 · buffer / 状态 · 计时 · trace"]
            viewer["Viewer + metrics<br/>状态回放 · 时间轴 · SR / 失败代价"]
            entry --> runner
            runner --> policy
            runner --> simulator
            runner --> shared_core
            policy --> shared_core
            simulator --> shared_core
            viewer -->|读取 trace| shared_core
        end
        collaboration -.开发约定.-> entry
        contracts -.事件契约.-> shared_core
    end

    future_consumers["后续 VLM / WM 调用方<br/>独立项目；单向依赖公共核心"]
    future_consumers --> shared_core

    subgraph external_envs["外部模拟环境：按需接入，各自锁定版本与资产"]
        direction LR
        mujoco_envs["LIBERO / RoboCasa<br/>robosuite · MuJoCo<br/>分别验证兼容性"]
        kinetix_env["Kinetix<br/>JAX · Jax2D<br/>保留编译与批量执行"]
        dom_env["DOM / DynamicVLA<br/>Isaac Lab · Isaac Sim<br/>独立仿真进程"]
        robotwin_env["RoboTwin<br/>选定版本的环境栈"]
    end
    simulator --> mujoco_envs
    simulator --> kinetix_env
    simulator --> dom_env
    simulator --> robotwin_env
    %% Invisible edge only keeps external environments below the shared core.
    shared_core ~~~ external_envs

    classDef existing fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#15803d,color:#14532d,stroke-width:1.5px
    classDef planned fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb,color:#172554,stroke-width:1.5px
    classDef external fill:#f1f5f9,stroke:#64748b,color:#0f172a,stroke-width:1.5px
    class collaboration,contracts existing
    class entry,runner,policy,simulator,shared_core,viewer planned
    class future_consumers,mujoco_envs,kinetix_env,dom_env,robotwin_env external
